# text = I am a bye-word all over Chigwell , and I say -- and it's fairer my saying so now , than waiting till you are dead , and I have got your money -- I say , that before long I shall be driven to break such bounds , and that when I do , it won't be me that you'll have to blame , but your own self , and no other You have always been a very good friend to me , Mr Varden I take it very kind of you to say all this , but the time's nearly come when the Maypole and I must part company Roving stones gather no moss , Joe Nor milestones much I'm little better than one here , and see as much of the world Then , what would you do , Joe What could you be ?
