# text = But as you are proceeding upon a mistake , Ned -- altogether upon a mistake -- I will conquer my repugnance to entering on such matters , and give you a perfectly plain and candid answer , if you will do me the favour to shut the door You have to thank me , Ned , for being of good family ; for your mother , charming person as she was , and almost broken-hearted , and so forth , as she left me , when she was prematurely compelled to become immortal -- had nothing to boast of in that respect Her father was at least an eminent lawyer , sir Quite right , Ned ; perfectly so .
