# text = He stood high at the bar , had a great name and great wealth , but having risen from nothing -- I have always closed my eyes to the circumstance and steadily resisted its contemplation , but I fear his father dealt in pork , and that his business did once involve cow-heel and sausages -- he wished to marry his daughter into a good family .
